---
ns: not-found
layout: layouts/not-found.njk
---
{% from "ui/macros.njk" import icon %}
<div class="forms-object" data-orbit>
  <span class="not-found-code" aria-hidden="true">404</span>
  <canvas aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <button type="button" class="forms-motion" aria-pressed="false" hidden>
    <span data-motion-pause>Pause motion</span><span data-motion-resume hidden>Resume motion</span>
  </button>
</div>
<p class="forms-status">404 · <span>Page not found</span></p>
<h1 class="forms-title"><span>Somehow,</span> <span>we stepped outside the story.</span></h1>
<p class="forms-copy"><span class="forms-explanation">There is no page at this address.</span><span>Go back. There is nothing here for you.</span></p>
<div class="forms-actions">
  <a href="/" class="forms-home"><span class="not-found-arrow">{{ icon('arrow') }}</span><span>Back to home</span></a>
  <a href="/" class="forms-back" data-not-found-back>Back to previous page</a>
</div>
